      "value": "Lot going on in this thread, but two things stuck out as interesting to me\n\n1) I thought VRChat relays the traffic, they do run the world logic on the \"instance master\", but I'm pretty sure the data is routed via their servers.\n\n2) Video player proxies. could get interesting with copyright laws and youtube monetization \n\nFor feature requests vrchat suggests two things\n\n1) see if anyones already submit something\n\n2) one idea per feedback post",
