      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Ability to set a proxy for the video players would be really nice. Maybe it could be implemented as an ability to set a custom URL resolver, instead of built-in youtube-dl? This way users can do any custom logic on URLs like filtering/proxying, and apply custom parameters (like not capping the youtube requested resolution at 720p), etc.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
